UPDATE question_bank SET prompt='You have a collection of reports for the HR department of your company. The datasets use row-level security

(RLS). The company has multiple sales regions.

Each sales region has an HR manager.

You need to ensure that the HR managers can interact with the data from their region only. The HR managers must

be prevented from changing the layout of the reports.

How should you provision access to the reports for the HR managers?',choices_json='["Publish the reports in an app and grant the HR managers access permission.","Create a new workspace, copy the datasets and reports, and add the HR managers as members of the workspace.","Publish the reports to a different workspace other than the one hosting the datasets.","Add the HR managers as members of the existing workspace that hosts the reports and the datasets."]',correct_json='[0]',explanation='ترجمة السؤال بالعربي
مديرو HR مطلوب يشوفوا بيانات منطقتهم فقط وفق RLS، ويتفاعلوا مع التقارير بدون تعديل تصميمها. كيف تمنحهم الوصول؟

القصة والمعنى
المدير جاي يقرأ دفتر منطقته، مش يبقى من فريق تأليف الدفاتر كلها. اعرض التقارير في App للمستهلكين، واحتفظ بصلاحيات التحرير لفريق الإعداد.

مثال نفهم بيه
منى مديرة HR في شرق: App يتيح لها التقرير، و RLS يقيد الصفوف بالشرق. لو جعلتها Member في workspace الموديل فلن يظل هذا هو نفس سياق المستهلك المقيد بـRLS.

طريقة التفكير خطوة بخطوة
1. انشر App وامنح المديرين صلاحية الاستهلاك، مع تعيينهم لأدوار RLS المناسبة وتحقق View as/Test as role.
2. App ليس هو الذي يخترع فلتر المنطقة؛ قاعدة RLS وعلاقة المستخدم بمنطقته يجب إعدادها مسبقًا.
3. لا تمنح Member في workspace المصدر؛ دوره يسمح بالتحرير و RLS لا يقيده كالمستهلك Viewer. ولا تمنح صلاحيات أوسع من المطلوب من طريق آخر.

الإجابة الصحيحة وليه
Publish the reports in an app and grant access، الاختيار الأول.

ليه كل اختيار صح أو غلط
A. Publish the reports in an app and grant the HR managers access permission.
صحيح: توزيع للمستهلكين مع الحفاظ على RLS المعد مسبقًا وعدم منح تحرير الأصل. لا تضف المستخدم لدور تحرير يتجاوز هذه القيود.

B. Create a new workspace, copy the datasets and reports, and add the HR managers as members of the workspace.
نسخ المحتوى وإعطاء Member يضيف إدارة زائدة وصلاحيات تحرير، ولا يحقق منع تغيير التصميم.

C. Publish the reports to a different workspace other than the one hosting the datasets.
نقل التقرير إلى workspace آخر وحده لا يحدد من يستطيع تحريره أوكيف تطبق قواعد المنطقة؛ المكان ليس بديلًا عن الصلاحيات.

D. Add the HR managers as members of the existing workspace that hosts the reports and the datasets.
Member في workspace المحتوي على الموديل لديه تحرير؛ لا يحقق القيد الأمني أوالتصميمي المطلوب.

الخلاصة اللي تتحفظ
RLS يحدد الصفوف، وصلاحية الوصول تحدد أقرأ أم أعدل. اضبط الاتنين.

مراجع المراجعة
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/security/service-admin-row-level-security
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-bi/collaborate-share/service-roles-new-workspaces',image=NULL,answer_image=NULL,context=NULL,rows_json=NULL WHERE id='f1-056-55' AND ((prompt IS 'You have a collection of reports for the HR department of your company. The datasets use row-level security

(RLS). The company has multiple sales regions.

Each sales region has an HR manager.

You need to ensure that the HR managers can interact with the data from their region only. The HR managers must

be prevented from changing the layout of the reports.

How should you provision access to the reports for the HR managers?' AND choices_json IS '["Publish the reports in an app and grant the HR managers access permission.","Create a new workspace, copy the datasets and reports, and add the HR managers as members of the workspace.","Publish the reports to a different workspace other than the one hosting the datasets.","Add the HR managers as members of the existing workspace that hosts the reports and the datasets."]' AND correct_json IS '[0]' AND explanation IS 'correct ans looks as A since an app would prevent to change the layout

In the Power BI service, members of a workspace have access to datasets in the workspace. RLS doesn''t
restrict this data access. and RLS is used to restrict access to data not to layout of the report. Members are
allowed to change the report layout.

Reference:

https://kunaltripathy.com/2021/10/06/bring-your-power-bi-to-power-apps-portal-part-ii/' AND image IS NULL AND answer_image IS NULL AND context IS NULL AND rows_json IS NULL) OR (prompt IS 'You have a collection of reports for the HR department of your company. The datasets use row-level security

(RLS). The company has multiple sales regions.

